[node name="Instructions" type="RichTextLabel" parent="HowToPlayPanel/VBoxContainer"]
layout_mode = 2
size_flags_vertical = 3
bbcode_enabled = true
text = "[b]Move[/b] with WASD or the arrow keys.

[b]Cast[/b] by pressing 1–6 and typing the spell shown, or press Space, type a learned spell and press Enter.

[b]Style[/b] rewards long, quick, clean casts and spell variety. Repeating a spell earns less bonus. Idle combo decays; losing health drops a rank. Your run score stays banked.

[b]Atomic[/b] unlocks at S. Press Space, type atomic, then Enter. Spend 1,500 combo to nuke the screen. Finish a run to enter local high scores.

Movement stops while typing. Each cast gets a fresh, limited slowdown window.

Backspace corrects a mistake; Escape cancels a cast or pauses.

Collect crystals to level up, learn spells and discover combinations.

At 20 minutes, extract with a victory or continue into endless survival."

[node name="BackButton" type="Button" parent="HowToPlayPanel/VBoxContainer"]
